### 1. 로그인 (토큰을 전역 변수로 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo-user", "password": "{{demo_password}}" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 2. 균형형 원칙 생성 (생성된 ID를 다음 요청에 전달)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/principles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "presetId": "balanced",
  "title": "S2.3 offline smoke 원칙"
}

> {% client.global.set("principle_id", response.body.data.principleId); %}

### 3. sanitized stored source로 주문 의도 평가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions/evaluate-order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "principleId": "{{principle_id}}",
  "portfolioSource": "KIS_MOCK",
  "orderIntent": {
    "symbol": "005930",
    "side": "BUY",
    "orderType": "MARKET",
    "quantity": 2,
    "estimatedPrice": 70000,
    "estimatedAmount": 140000,
    "timeframe": "1d",
    "strategyId": "cash-equity-v1"
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("decision_id", response.body.data.decisionId); %}

### 4. owner-scoped Decision 상세
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions/{{decision_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. owner-scoped sanitized audit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions/{{decision_id}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
